- **[Project Overview & PDR](docs/project-overview-pdr.md)** - Requirements, features, roadmap
- **[System Architecture](docs/system-architecture.md)** - Detailed architecture diagrams
- **[Codebase Summary](docs/codebase-summary.md)** - Directory structure, modules
